%% MyStreet.id — User Workflow (Spec Section 4: Workflow Pengguna)
%% Reflects the actual local-first product: everything happens in the browser.
flowchart TD
    A([Open MyStreet.id]) --> B[Landing: understand the product]
    B --> C[Go to Dashboard]
    C --> D{Have a portfolio?}
    D -- No --> E[Create a new portfolio draft]
    D -- Yes --> F[Open existing draft from local storage]
    E --> G[Edit content in the Editor]
    F --> G
    G --> H[See the live Preview]
    H --> I{Happy with it?}
    I -- No --> G
    I -- Yes --> J[Mark as public or keep private - local flag]
    J --> K[Export: print / PDF to truly share]
    K --> L([Done - draft stays in this browser])
    J --> M[Open local view at /p/:slug in this browser]
    M --> L
